* bench.id: rob_hs_ff_whitespace_only
* bench.group: robustness
* bench.title: a file with only blanks, tabs and a CRLF
* bench.expect: loud_error
* bench.tags: hostile, file, encoding, whitespace
* bench.est_rss_mib: 64
* bench.note: no circuit: a refusal is the correct behaviour; ngspice-47 prints 'Warning: Empty netlist!' and exits 0 without writing a rawfile
